WHY GPL-3.0

This project is licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later because it links against
CGAL's Surface_mesh_simplification package, which is GPL-licensed.

If you need to avoid the GPL copyleft requirements (e.g. for a closed-source
game), you can:
1. Use only the non-CGAL methods (meshoptimizer, Open3D, fast-simplification),
   which are all MIT-licensed.
2. Obtain a commercial CGAL license from GeometryFactory
   (https://geometryfactory.com).

CITATION

If you use this software in academic work, please cite:

Gallo, L. (2026). Comparative Analysis of Open-Source Mesh Simplification
Methods for Game Development. Master's Thesis, Breda University of Applied
Sciences.

See CITATION.cff for machine-readable citation metadata.
